<item><title>Eswatini plans more local electricity generation</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sz/eswatini-plans-more-local-electricity-generation-39a931/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sz/eswatini-plans-more-local-electricity-generation-39a931/</guid><category>Eswatini</category><description>Government is working on hydropower, solar and geothermal projects to cut reliance on power imported from neighbouring countries, and says regional cooperation remains essential.</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 09:31:32 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sz.jpg" length="32835" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sz.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Eswatini U-23 AFCON dream ends in Algeria</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sz/eswatini-u-23-afcon-dream-ends-in-algeria-5f4496/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sz/eswatini-u-23-afcon-dream-ends-in-algeria-5f4496/</guid><category>Eswatini</category><description>Algeria defeated Eswatini 3-1 in the second leg, securing a 4-3 aggregate victory and ending Eswatini&apos;s hopes of reaching the continental finals.</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 01:01:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sz.jpg" length="32835" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sz.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Pupil, 14, drowns in Mbabane River after leaving school to swim</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sz/pupil-14-drowns-in-mbabane-river-after-leaving-school-to-63b2af/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sz/pupil-14-drowns-in-mbabane-river-after-leaving-school-to-63b2af/</guid><category>Eswatini</category><description>Police and fire rescue divers recovered the body of the Form I pupil from Hermann Gmeiner (SOS) High School several hours after the drowning was reported.</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 01:00:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sz.jpg" length="32835" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sz.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Eswatini finance minister admits 30,000 jobs not enough</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sz/eswatini-finance-minister-admits-30-000-jobs-not-enough-7a4916/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sz/eswatini-finance-minister-admits-30-000-jobs-not-enough-7a4916/</guid><category>Eswatini</category><description>Neal Rijkenberg said about 190,000 people are seeking work, a gap his government&apos;s current job creation plans will not close.</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 18:13:26 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/sz/eswatini-finance-minister-admits-30-000-jobs-not-enough-7a4916/share.jpg" length="39916" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/sz/eswatini-finance-minister-admits-30-000-jobs-not-enough-7a4916/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Eswatini sets 2030 goal to halve road deaths and injuries</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sz/eswatini-sets-2030-goal-to-halve-road-deaths-and-injuries-10fa9b/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sz/eswatini-sets-2030-goal-to-halve-road-deaths-and-injuries-10fa9b/</guid><category>Eswatini</category><description>Police and transport officials say the target rests on tougher enforcement, safer roads and public education, after 108 road deaths were recorded this year.</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 12:53:28 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sz.jpg" length="32835" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sz.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
